      "description": "Create subtitles without friction. Import a video, tap Transcribe, review the smart timestamps, then Export SRT. Works great for lectures, interviews, reels, tutorials, and client projects.\n\nOne-tap SRT/VTT. Clean cue timing formatted for major platforms.\nAccurate ASR. Modern speech-to-text with punctuation and casing.\nTimestamp editor. Fix words and shift timings inline.\nLarge video support. Handles long sessions reliably.\nBatch safety. Autosave protects work during long transcodes.\nExport anywhere. Share to Files, Drive, or your editor.\nNo accounts. Use immediately.\nClear privacy. Audio is processed securely; results live on your device.\n\nPerfect for Creators, teachers, marketers, social teams, podcasters, and anyone who needs fast captions that pass QA.\n\n1) Select Video → 2) Transcribe → 3) Review + edit → 4) Export SRT/VTT.\nTip: Keep speech clear and reduce background noise for best accuracy.\n\nInitial release with video import, server transcription, inline editor, and SRT export.\nPerformance and reliability tuning for long videos.",
